cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use XRFM, please cite this software repository and the exact model or dataset revisions you used."
title: "XR Foundation Model (XRFM)"
abstract: >-
  XRFM is an open-source multilingual foundation-model research project with an
  original decoder-only transformer track trained from random initialization and
  a separately attributed QLoRA defensive-coding track.
type: software
authors:
